### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000

### List recent audit trails
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/audit-trails
Accept: application/json

### Filter by action type
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/audit-trails?action=created
Accept: application/json

### Filter by user
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/audit-trails?user_id=1
Accept: application/json

### Get audit trail for specific model (polymorphic)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/audit-trails?auditable_type=App\Models\BorrowingRequest&auditable_id=1
Accept: application/json

### Get audit trail for an item
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/items/1/audit-trails
Accept: application/json

### Get audit trail for a borrowing request
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/borrowing-requests/1/audit-trails
Accept: application/json

### Search in recent audit trails
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/audit-trails?search=admin
Accept: application/json